{"path":"chemistry/principles/rate-balance/conversion-rate","title":"化学平衡·转化率随温度与压强变化","type":"example","html":"<p>在一定温度下，密闭容器中进行反应 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{A(g)+B(g)\\rightleftharpoons C(g)}\\ \\ \\Delta H&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇌</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>，反应达到平衡后，下列改变可使 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">A</span></span></span></span> 的转化率增大的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. 升高温度</p>\n<p>B. 增大压强</p>\n<p>C. 恒容条件下通入不反应的惰性气体</p>\n<p>D. 减小压强</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>转化率-温度图像</strong>（放热反应）：其他条件不变，升温（平衡逆移）⇒ A 的转化率随温度升高<strong>单调下降</strong>；吸热反应 <strong>单调上升</strong>——一条单调曲线，没有&quot;先升后降&quot;（除非多重平衡/催化剂失效）；</li>\n<li><strong>转化率-压强图像</strong>：气体分子数减少方向正反应（本题 2→1）⇒ 转化率随 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span> 增大<strong>先陡后缓</strong>上升（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span> 足够大时趋平）；若气体分子数不变（如 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_A+n_B=n_C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 差值 0）则压强不影响转化率；</li>\n<li>恒压通惰气：容积胀大⇒有效分压下降⇒相当于减压（与恒容通惰气不同！）；</li>\n<li>变式叠加题：给出<strong>图像</strong>（转化率-温度，两曲线对应两压强）判断哪条是高压/低压——画&quot;两点连线&quot;：同温度压强高者转化率高（本题）或低者（视计量数差）；</li>\n<li>真题关联：化学平衡移动与图像是新课标化学选填必考点。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>勒夏特列原理</strong>：改变平衡条件的瞬间，平衡向&quot;减弱这种改变&quot;的方向移动。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A（升温）</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta H&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.08125em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>（放热），加热促进<strong>吸热方向</strong>（逆反应），平衡逆移，A 的转化率<strong>减小</strong> ✗；</li>\n<li><strong>B（加压）</strong>：反应物气体计量数之和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+1=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span> &gt; 生成物 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>——增大压强平衡向<strong>气体分子数减少</strong>的方向（正向）移动，A 的转化率<strong>增大</strong> ✓；</li>\n<li><strong>C（恒容惰气）</strong>：恒容下通惰性气体，体系总压升高但各组分<strong>浓度没变</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=\\dfrac{n}{V}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.22222em;\">V</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 不变），平衡<strong>不移动</strong> ✗；</li>\n<li><strong>D（减压）</strong>：与 B 相反，平衡向气体分子数增多方向（逆）移动，转化率<strong>减小</strong> ✗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>B</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>两个&quot;看&quot;定方向</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>①看 ΔH</strong>：放热（ΔH&lt;0）升温逆移；吸热（ΔH&gt;0）升温正移——<strong>&quot;热往哪去，平衡就躲哪&quot;</strong>；\n<strong>②看气体计量数</strong>：加压 → 往&quot;分子少的一边&quot;躲；减压 → 往&quot;分子多的一边&quot;躲；\n<strong>第三个&quot;记住&quot;</strong>：恒容通惰气=浓度没变=不移动（恒压通惰气则体积膨胀相当于减压→向分子多方向移动）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：转化率变化 = 平衡移动方向直接体现——正移转化率增、逆移转化率减；温度改变还影响平衡常数（放热升温 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.07153em;\">K</span></span></span></span> 减小），所以升温必逆移。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 B。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"在一定温度下，密闭容器中进行反应 A ( g ) + B ( g ) ⇌ C ( g ) Δ H &lt; 0 \\mathrm{A(g)+B(g)\\rightleftharpoons C(g)}\\ \\ \\Delta H&lt;0 A ( g","source":"自编（经典考法：勒夏特列+转化率图像为新高考高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"升温向\"吸热方向\"移动（放热反应⇒逆移，转化率降）；加压向\"气体体积减小方向\"移动；恒容通惰性气体浓度不变⇒平衡不移动；图像题注意横轴纵轴是\"转化率——温度/压强\"还是\"转化率——时间\"。先看 ΔH 符号和气体计量数差，一招定方向。","fit":["转化率随温度/压强变化","勒夏特列原理应用","选填题"],"updated":"Wed Mar 05 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"chemistry","title":"化学"},{"slug":"principles","title":"化学反应原理"},{"slug":"rate-balance","title":"速率与平衡"},{"slug":"conversion-rate","title":"化学平衡·转化率随温度与压强变化"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"dual-equilibrium","title":"双平衡·串联反应综合三段式","type":"example"},{"slug":"equilibrium-calc-template","title":"化学平衡常数计算·三段式（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"equilibrium-k","title":"平衡常数计算（三段式心算）","type":"example"},{"slug":"equilibrium-problem-template","title":"反应原理综合大题·四步模板","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"equivalent-equilibrium","title":"等效平衡判断（恒温恒容）","type":"example"},{"slug":"inert-gas","title":"惰性气体对平衡的影响（恒容/恒压两重天）","type":"example"},{"slug":"rate-balance","title":"反应速率与化学平衡","type":"knowledge"}]}